  "availability": "partial",
  "reason": "The standard household tariffs (10 to 60 amperes) of Hokuriku Electric Power, which supplies Toyama and Ishikawa, from its price page. Prices include consumption tax. The monthly fuel cost adjustment and the renewable energy levy are not in them, so a bill is lower than a real one. Other regions and suppliers are not held yet: several large utilities refuse automated requests.",
  "reason_local": {
    "language": "ja",
    "text": "北陸電力（富山県・石川県）の標準的な家庭向け料金（10〜60アンペア）を、同社の料金ページから読み取っています。料金には消費税を含みます。毎月の燃料費調整額と再生可能エネルギー発電促進賦課金は含まれないため、実際の請求額より低くなります。他の地域・事業者はまだ対象外で、大手電力の一部は自動アクセスを拒否します。"
  },
